      "slide": 5,
      "point": "Capacity constraint rests on inference, not buyer data — no utilization rate, waitlist or turned-away orders. The whole investment thesis hangs on this unproven claim.",
      "severity": "high",
      "fix": "Show roastery utilization %, waitlist or declined orders from BeanBox's operations; otherwise present it as a hypothesis to be validated."
